  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Country Partnership for the Lao People&apos;s Democratic Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PCPfor Lao PDR is a multi-component initiative supporting the country#s transition from LDC status through inclusive and sustainable industrial development. Focused on economic diversification (trade competitiveness, SME formalization), sustainable agro-value chains, and green industrial transformation (climate resilience, circular economy), the program integrates gender equality and environmental safeguards. It aims to strengthen institutional capacities, enhance regional market integration, and promote low-carbon, equitable growth aligned with national priorities and global sustainability goals.</narrative>
  </description>
